\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Lotka-Volterra predator-prey system identified via 2D RBF (exact linear-stage solve of the bilinear homotopy framework). (a)~Phase portrait showing the oscillatory cycle (true trajectory: solid black; identified: dashed red; training data: blue circles). (b)~Prey population $x(t)$ over time. (c)~Predator population $y(t)$ over time. The identified model preserves the qualitative oscillatory structure over $\sim $2.3 periods, with maximum absolute errors of 1.73 (prey) and 2.75 (predator).}}{20}{figure.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:lotka-volterra}{{4}{20}{Lotka-Volterra predator-prey system identified via 2D RBF (exact linear-stage solve of the bilinear homotopy framework). (a)~Phase portrait showing the oscillatory cycle (true trajectory: solid black; identified: dashed red; training data: blue circles). (b)~Prey population $x(t)$ over time. (c)~Predator population $y(t)$ over time. The identified model preserves the qualitative oscillatory structure over $\sim $2.3 periods, with maximum absolute errors of 1.73 (prey) and 2.75 (predator)}{figure.4}{}}
